      <guid>http://localhost:1313/posts/2021-12-10-aoc-2021-day10/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;advent-of-code-2021---day-10-syntax-scoring&#34;&gt;&#xA;  Advent of Code 2021 - Day 10: Syntax Scoring&#xA;  &lt;a class=&#34;heading-link&#34; href=&#34;#advent-of-code-2021---day-10-syntax-scoring&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;i class=&#34;fa-solid fa-link&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; title=&#34;Link to heading&#34;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&#xA;    &lt;span class=&#34;sr-only&#34;&gt;Link to heading&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;This year&amp;rsquo;s &lt;a href=&#34;https://adventofcode.com/&#34;  class=&#34;external-link&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;Advent of Code&lt;/a&gt; has some very nice puzzles so far and brings some joy into this somehow dark &lt;em&gt;Covid&lt;/em&gt;-Prechristmas time.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;day-10-syntax-scoring&#34;&gt;&#xA;  Day 10: Syntax Scoring&#xA;  &lt;a class=&#34;heading-link&#34; href=&#34;#day-10-syntax-scoring&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;i class=&#34;fa-solid fa-link&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; title=&#34;Link to heading&#34;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&#xA;    &lt;span class=&#34;sr-only&#34;&gt;Link to heading&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Link: &lt;a href=&#34;https://adventofcode.com/2021/day/1&#34;  class=&#34;external-link&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;Day 10&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Our input contains of lines containing numerous &lt;strong&gt;chunks&lt;/strong&gt;, which consist of an opening bracket (&lt;code&gt;(,[,{,&amp;lt;&lt;/code&gt;) and the matching closing bracket (&lt;code&gt;),],},&amp;gt;&lt;/code&gt;). While a valid chunck may contain other chunks (or none), chunks are not allowed to overlap. &lt;code&gt;(())&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;([])&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;(&amp;lt;&amp;gt;&amp;lt;&amp;gt;[()])&lt;/code&gt; are examples for &lt;em&gt;valid&lt;/em&gt; chunks, &lt;code&gt;([)]&lt;/code&gt; or &lt;code&gt;((([)))]]&lt;/code&gt; are considered &lt;em&gt;illegal&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
