    <item>
      <title>Hackerrank: XOR - Sequence</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/posts/hackerrank-xor-sequence/</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 31 Aug 2021 17:12:46 +0200</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/posts/hackerrank-xor-sequence/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;xor---sequence&#34;&gt;&#xA;  Xor - Sequence&#xA;  &lt;a class=&#34;heading-link&#34; href=&#34;#xor---sequence&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;i class=&#34;fa-solid fa-link&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; title=&#34;Link to heading&#34;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&#xA;    &lt;span class=&#34;sr-only&#34;&gt;Link to heading&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;We are given an Array $A$, which is defined as follows:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;$A_0 = 0$&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;$A_n = A_{n-1} \oplus n$&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The beginning of this array looks like this:&#xA;$ A = [0,1,3,0,4,1,7,0,8,1,11,\dots]$&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;task&#34;&gt;&#xA;  Task&#xA;  &lt;a class=&#34;heading-link&#34; href=&#34;#task&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;i class=&#34;fa-solid fa-link&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; title=&#34;Link to heading&#34;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&#xA;    &lt;span class=&#34;sr-only&#34;&gt;Link to heading&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;For a given $l,r$ with $l \leq r$, we have to compute the XOR sum of the segement of $A$&#xA;$$A[l] \oplus A[l+1] \oplus \dots \oplus A[r-1]\oplus A[r]$$&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>About me</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/about/</link>
